# Formspree Form IDs
# https://formspree.io/
# 
# To set up:
# 1. Create a Formspree account at https://formspree.io
# 2. Create two forms in your dashboard:
#    - One for contact form submissions (Contact & Feedback page)
#    - One for feedback form submissions (Contact & Feedback page)
#    - One for quote/pricing inquiries (Pricing page)
# 3. Copy the form ID (alphanumeric string after /f/) and paste below
#
# Form submission endpoints look like:
# https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID
#
# Production environment: Create a .env.production file with your real form IDs
# Local development: Create a .env file with your test form IDs (optional)

VITE_FORMSPREE_CONTACT_FORM_ID=your_contact_form_id_here
VITE_FORMSPREE_FEEDBACK_FORM_ID=your_feedback_form_id_here
